        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Augmente fortement le taux de critiques.\nUtilisable une seule fois.\nL’effet disparaît si le Pokémon est retiré.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hebt einmalig die Volltrefferquote des Pokémon im\nKampf stark an. Die Wirkung endet mit dem Austausch\ndes Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta el índice de golpe crítico en combate. Solo\nse puede usar una vez y, al cambiar de Pokémon, el\nefecto desaparece.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta la probabilità di sferrare brutti colpi.\nSi può usare una sola volta e l’effetto svanisce\nse il Pokémon è sostituito.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item that greatly raises the critical-hit ratio of\na Pokémon during a battle. It can be used only once\nand wears off if the Pokémon is withdrawn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "急所率が　大きく　あがる。\n１度しか　使うことが　できない。\nひっこめると　元に　戻る。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "击中要害的几率会大幅提高。\n只能使用１次。\n离场后，效果便会消失。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta el índice de golpe crítico en combate. Solo\nse puede usar una vez y, al cambiar de Pokémon, el\nefecto desaparece.",
      "version_group": {
